#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:1
msgid "E4221"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `control_in_with_pattern_default`."
msgstr "编译器诊断名称：`control_in_with_pattern_default`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:5
msgid ""
"A default expression in an or-pattern's `with` clause attempts to "
"transfer control with `return`, `break`, `continue`, or `raise`. The "
"default must produce a value locally and cannot leave its surrounding "
"pattern."
msgstr ""
"or-pattern 的 `with` 子句中的默认表达式试图通过 `return`、`break`、`continue` 或 `raise` 转移控制流。默认表达式必须在局部产生值，不能离开所在的模式。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:9
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:11
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn value_or_zero(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  match value {\n"
"    Some(x) | (None with x = { return 0 }) => x\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:15
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:17
msgid ""
"Use a plain value as the default and perform any control flow after the "
"pattern has matched."
msgstr ""
"默认值应使用普通表达式；需要的控制流应在模式匹配完成后执行。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4221.md:20
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn value_or_zero(value : Int?) -> Int {\n"
"  match value {\n"
"    Some(x) | (None with x = 0) => x\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
